  "question": {
    "text": "If the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></math> is:"
